model {
  extend basalt.toolsGateway {
    metadata {
      constraint "The storage.statement.batch span measures the complete bounded statement lifecycle, including cancellation settling, under the unchanged ten-second deadline. The public MCP proof bounds that delivered span to ten through twelve seconds; client timing remains diagnostic because catalog discovery and transport are outside the statement deadline. Typed failure, held-resource release, no author dispatch, fresh-call recovery and cancellation remain independently asserted."
    }
  }
}
